cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ForecastForge
message: >-
  If you use ForecastForge in your work, please cite it using this
  metadata and the version you used.
type: software
authors:
  - name: ForecastForge Contributors
    website: "https://github.com/Abolfazlrwm/forecastforge"
description: >-
  An open-source time-series forecasting library with leakage-safe feature
  engineering, a leakage-safe walk-forward backtester, and a reproducible
  benchmark of baseline and statistical models on deterministic data.
keywords:
  - forecasting
  - time-series
  - backtesting
  - data-leakage
  - machine-learning
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abolfazlrwm/forecastforge"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
